  Prefab: {fileID: 6625514644646704096, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  Interactable: {fileID: 5048261325816738630, guid: 784d78f741f159b4fa345687039dccf0, type: 3}
  TextFields:
  - 
  - "Astrid\u2014\n\nNo easy way to say this. It's looking like I\u2019m going to
    have to stay at the South Pole a little longer. \n\nI\u2019m sorry, Bear. You
    mean more to me than the whole celestial sphere. But this work\u2014it matters,
    too. I know you understand. You were just a toddler the first time you spotted
    Ursa Major by yourself.  \n\nDid you know Antarctica means the land with no bears?
    And Arctic means land of bears. Most people think it\u2019s about polar bears
    (which, yes, only live up north), but the name actually comes from the sky. You
    can\u2019t see the bear constellations from down here. Say hello to them for
    me, will you?\n\nLove,\nUrsa Major"
